# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Never commit secrets (AGENTS.md golden rule 4). This list is defensive: these
# files should not exist in the repo at all, but if one is ever copied in or
# captured with `chezmoi add`, we want git to refuse it.
#
# NOTE: age-encrypted files (*.age) ARE meant to be committed and are therefore
# intentionally NOT ignored.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Secrets / keys / credentials
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.jks
**/*.ppk
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/id_dsa*
**/*.ppk
**/.netrc
**/.htpasswd
**/credentials
**/credentials.json
**/*-credentials.json
**/service-account*.json
**/kubeconfig
**/auth.json
**/*.secret

# Tool / cloud credential stores (guard against `chezmoi add` sweeping them in)
**/opencode/service.json
**/opencode/auth.json
**/opencode/opencode.db
**/opencode/opencode.db-*
**/chezmoi/chezmoi.toml
**/.aws/credentials
**/.aws/config
**/.docker/config.json
**/.gcloud/
**/terraform.tfstate
**/terraform.tfstate.*
**/*.tfvars
**/.npmrc
**/.pypirc
**/.pgpass
**/.my.cnf

# OS / editor cruft
**/.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/*~
**/.#*
**/\#*\#

# Generated
Brewfile.lock.json
